{"3691430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ritus Exorcismus", "steam_appid": 3691430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demonic possessions</strong> are increasing all over the land. You are a priest being trained by the church to <strong>perform exorcisms</strong>. Equipped with your <strong>Exorcism Book</strong> and a case of <strong>Holy Relics</strong> you are sent to aid the afflicted population.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demonic possessions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is being overwhelmed by evil. In each chapter of the story you will travel to a different village, and it is your duty as an exorcist to cast all demons out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/914801b02c091f942d8e40f4c9b63c6b.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel and experience events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Abbey is the only holy refuge for the villages around it. Each village will present different scenarios and possessed villagers. Exorcising the possessed is your main task, but animals and the land itself are also being corrupted. You will have to handle all of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique events can reward you with powerful relics that once belonged to saints and martyrs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/220b796ae36218e46cf593cbf986c886.poster.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/220b796ae36218e46cf593cbf986c886.webm?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/220b796ae36218e46cf593cbf986c886.mp4?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Book of exorcisms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your book contains information about all demons and demonic signs manifested by the possessed. Find the page that matches the current demonic sign and select the correct holy relic to counter the demon's actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain experience, you will know the book by heart and will truly feel as a bona fide exorcist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/0d32eb623c0e23cd4374b76ad35bce77.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Holy Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be equipped with six holy relics: Crucifix, Blessed Candles, Holy Water, Anointing Oil, Incense and Salt. Each relic has a unique minigame that you must complete to counter a demonic sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel to different locations, you may find new relics that can have a decisive impact on the outcome of minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/b56bb2cde37dc2c305586792a3630dfd.poster.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/b56bb2cde37dc2c305586792a3630dfd.webm?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/b56bb2cde37dc2c305586792a3630dfd.mp4?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Empower your Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After liberating a village from evil, its inhabitants will give you <strong>offerings</strong> as a token of their gratitude. These offerings can be used to upgrade your relics, giving you an ever increasing advantage against the demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/d884e18e8f93975cec8c27b5ddf4c994.poster.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/d884e18e8f93975cec8c27b5ddf4c994.webm?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/d884e18e8f93975cec8c27b5ddf4c994.mp4?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all exorcisms will end successfully and some souls will be lost. The amount of lost souls and your choices will determine what kind of ending you will get. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i><strong>Our help is in the name of the Lord</strong></i>.&quot; - Blessing of Saint Benedict Medal</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demonic possessions</strong> are increasing all over the land. You are a priest being trained by the church to <strong>perform exorcisms</strong>. Equipped with your <strong>Exorcism Book</strong> and a case of <strong>Holy Relics</strong> you are sent to aid the afflicted population.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demonic possessions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is being overwhelmed by evil. In each chapter of the story you will travel to a different village, and it is your duty as an exorcist to cast all demons out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/914801b02c091f942d8e40f4c9b63c6b.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel and experience events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Abbey is the only holy refuge for the villages around it. Each village will present different scenarios and possessed villagers. Exorcising the possessed is your main task, but animals and the land itself are also being corrupted. You will have to handle all of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique events can reward you with powerful relics that once belonged to saints and martyrs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/220b796ae36218e46cf593cbf986c886.poster.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/220b796ae36218e46cf593cbf986c886.webm?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/220b796ae36218e46cf593cbf986c886.mp4?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Book of exorcisms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your book contains information about all demons and demonic signs manifested by the possessed. Find the page that matches the current demonic sign and select the correct holy relic to counter the demon's actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain experience, you will know the book by heart and will truly feel as a bona fide exorcist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/0d32eb623c0e23cd4374b76ad35bce77.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Holy Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be equipped with six holy relics: Crucifix, Blessed Candles, Holy Water, Anointing Oil, Incense and Salt. Each relic has a unique minigame that you must complete to counter a demonic sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel to different locations, you may find new relics that can have a decisive impact on the outcome of minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/b56bb2cde37dc2c305586792a3630dfd.poster.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/b56bb2cde37dc2c305586792a3630dfd.webm?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/b56bb2cde37dc2c305586792a3630dfd.mp4?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Empower your Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After liberating a village from evil, its inhabitants will give you <strong>offerings</strong> as a token of their gratitude. These offerings can be used to upgrade your relics, giving you an ever increasing advantage against the demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/d884e18e8f93975cec8c27b5ddf4c994.poster.avif?t=1784133396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/d884e18e8f93975cec8c27b5ddf4c994.webm?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/extras/d884e18e8f93975cec8c27b5ddf4c994.mp4?t=1784133396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all exorcisms will end successfully and some souls will be lost. The amount of lost souls and your choices will determine what kind of ending you will get. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i><strong>Our help is in the name of the Lord</strong></i>.&quot; - Blessing of Saint Benedict Medal</p>", "short_description": "Become the exorcist that the world needs! Use Holy Relics and the knowledge from your book to fight demonic possessions. Investigate unholy events and take part in church rituals in this medieval pixel horror game.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/ea3a4362387957370d63cf023a77b6595cbba850/header.jpg?t=1784133396", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/4643756c407182ab8b0e8d2ff24bb7037467c121/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784133396", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691430/4643756c407182ab8b0e8d2ff24bb7037467c121/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784133396", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Video Card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any model</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22 